OL,3,ABritish man missing after diving into
OL,4,ALake Como to rescue teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian authorities are searching for a
OL,7,FBritish man who went missing after
OL,8,Fdiving into Lake Como to rescue a
OL,9,Fteenager.
OL,11,FThe local coastguard said the man, in
OL,12,Fhis late thirties, had been attempting
OL,13,Fto rescue two people - a father and his
OL,14,F16-year-old son - who were in distress
OL,15,Fin the water near the lake's western
OL,16,Fshore on Monday afternoon, local
OL,17,Fofficials said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
